#. Translators: The message reported when the user turns off color inversion.
#: addon\globalPlugins\winMag\__init__.py:1229
msgid "Color inversion off"
msgstr "Farveinvertering fra"

#. Translators: A view type reported when the user changes the Magnifier view.
#. See the view menu items in the Magnifier's toolbar.
#: addon\globalPlugins\winMag\__init__.py:1239
msgid "Docked"
msgstr "Forankret visning"

#. Translators: A view type reported when the user changes the Magnifier view.
#. See the view menu items in the Magnifier's toolbar.
#: addon\globalPlugins\winMag\__init__.py:1243
